---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Formules sono et lumière à Amiens | Event'Light"
description: "Packs mariage, anniversaire, CE et sport à Amiens : sono, lumière, étincelles froides, animateur. Montage et démontage inclus, devis personnalisé."
permalink: "/nos-formules/"
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Nos formules
---
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    {% include "breadcrumbs.njk" %}
    <p class="page-kicker mono">FORMULES</p>
    <h1>Nos formules</h1>
    {% for p in formules.intro %}
    <p class="lede">{{ p }}</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </header>

  <ul class="cards">
    {% for f in formules.pages %}
    <li>
      <a class="card-link" href="/nos-formules/{{ f.slug }}/">
        <div class="frame {{ f.slug | frameClass }}" data-duration="{{ 120 + loop.index0 * 20 }}" onmousemove="scrub(event,this)" onmouseleave="resetScrub(this)">
          <span class="badge mono">CH. {% if loop.index < 10 %}0{% endif %}{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <div class="controls"><span class="time mono">0:00</span><div class="bar"><div class="playhead"></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="cap">{{ f.titre }}<span class="date">{{ f.seoDescription }}</span></div>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
